  triage:title "Missing smart constructor enforcing kind/body invariant on ResolvedBuiltInNudgeTemplate/InternalNudgeEnvelope" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-core/src/boundary/mod.rs:198-215 -- ResolvedBuiltInNudgeTemplate / InternalNudgeEnvelope have no impl block or smart constructor anywhere in the workspace, permitting invalid states (e.g. kind and body: None/Some combinations that shouldn't coexist per the sprint doc's own Interfaces section). Lower urgency given AD27-ARCH-001 (these structs are presently unused on the live path), but a real risk if ever wired live without this gap being closed first." ;
